{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>You shall surely tithe</b> etc. is juxtaposed to <b>the produce of the field, year by year</b> — to <b>in milk</b>: to say, just as a mixture of meat in milk is forbidden, so too the mixture of kil'ayim in the field is forbidden. And if you guard against the mixture, then I will ripen your fruits in their season and they will be tithed. And <b>in its mother's milk</b> is juxtaposed to <b>year by year</b>: to say that a nursing woman's friend may not marry within two years, and the child will be in its mother's milk for two years."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:43.464476434Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}